        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Foundation" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Chain 3, join to ring. Round 1: ch 3, 2 tr, ch 5, *3 tr, ch 5; repeat from * 3 times (4 sections). Join." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Rounds 2 to 5 (shaping)" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "At the two top positions work 5 tr, ch 7, 5 tr into each corner space (lobe increases). At the two base positions work 3 tr, ch 3, 3 tr (no extra increase). At the bottom centre stitch, work a tr-2-together to begin the V-decrease. Repeat lobe increases and base V-decreases for 5 rounds." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Finishing" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Fasten off and weave in the end. Block by pinning the two lobes apart and the base to a sharp point." }]
      }
